":-16.87,"default_fair_val":-16.87,"premium_pct":-312.3,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":731.6,"pe_forward":643.8,"pb_trailing":1.1,"pb_forward":1,"div_yield":3.04,"ps_ratio":8.4,"fcf_to_ev":1.39,"fcf_to_mcap":2.96,"liab_to_assets":57.5,"cash_to_assets":3.7,"current_ratio":2.02,"roe":0.2,"roa":0.1,"moat":{"ticker":"VNO","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"VNO 作為一家辦公室 REIT，其品牌定價權相對有限。雖然其在紐約等核心市場擁有優質物業，但租戶的選擇主要基於地理位置、租金成本和空間需求，而非品牌忠誠度。與消費品品牌不同，辦公空間的租賃決策較少受品牌情感驅動。因此，VNO 的品牌價值更多體現在其物業組合的整體品質和管理水平上，而非獨立的定價權壁壘。其租金定價主要受市場供需關係和宏觀經濟環境影響，競爭對手眾多，難以形成顯著的溢價能力。","comment_en":"As an office REIT, VNO's brand pricing power is relatively limited. While it owns prime properties in core markets like New York, tenant decisions are primarily based on location, rental costs, and space requirements, rather than brand loyalty. Unlike consumer brands, leasing decisions for office space are less driven by brand emotion. Therefore, VNO's brand value is more reflected in the overall quality and management of its property portfolio, rather than an independent pricing power barrier. Its rental pricing is mainly influenced by market supply and demand dynamics and the macroeconomic environment, with numerous competitors making it difficult to form significant premium capabilities."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"辦公室 REIT 業務本身不涉及專利或特許經營權。VNO 的營運主要依賴於對房地產的擁有、開發和管理，這類業務的進入壁壘主要體現在資金實力、開發經驗和對市場的理解，而非受專利法或政府特許保護。因此，在專利和特許權維度上，VNO 不具備任何經濟護城河。","comment_en":"The office REIT business itself does not involve patents or exclusive licenses. VNO's operations primarily rely on owning, developing, and managing real estate. The barriers to entry in this type of business are mainly reflected in financial strength, development experience, and market understanding, rather than protection by patent law or government franchises. Therefore, VNO possesses no economic moat in terms of patents and regulatory exclusivity."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於租戶而言，搬遷辦公室涉及相當高的轉換成本。這包括實體搬遷的費用、新空間的裝修、員工適應新環境的時間與成本，以及潛在的業務中斷。尤其對於大型企業租戶，其辦公空間的佈局和設施往往高度客製化，更換供應商的成本顯著。VNO 作為辦公空間的提供者，能夠從中受益，但這種轉換成本更多是租戶層面的考量，而非 VNO 自身業務模式的直接壁壘。","comment_en":"For tenants, relocating office space involves considerable switching costs. This includes physical moving expenses, renovation of the new space, the time and cost for employees to adapt to a new environment, and potential business disruptions. Especially for large corporate tenants, the layout and facilities of their office space are often highly customized, making the cost of changing suppliers significant. VNO, as an office space provider, benefits from this, but these switching costs are more of a tenant-side consideration than a direct barrier of VNO's business model."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"辦公室 REIT 的業務模式本質上不具備網絡效應。租戶選擇辦公空間主要基於其自身需求，而非其他租戶的使用情況。一個租戶的加入或退出，對其他租戶的價值影響微乎其微。與社交媒體、電商平台或支付系統不同，辦公空間的價值並非隨著用戶數量的增加而呈指數級增長。因此，VNO 在此維度上沒有顯著的護城河。","comment_en":"The business model of an office REIT inherently lacks network effects. Tenants choose office space primarily based on their own needs, not on the usage patterns of other tenants. The addition or departure of one tenant has a negligible impact on the value for other tenants. Unlike social media, e-commerce platforms, or payment systems, the value of office space does not grow exponentially with the increase in user numbers. Therefore, VNO has no significant moat in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"VNO 作為一家大型辦公室 REIT，其規模帶來了一定的成本優勢。在物業採購、融資、保險和物業管理等方面，較大的營運規模有助於降低單位成本。例如，與小型業主相比，VNO 在與供應商談判時可能獲得更有利的價格。此外，其多元化的物業組合有助於分散風險，並可能通過集中採購和管理實現效率提升。然而，房地產行業的資本密集性意味著規模優勢並非絕對，且市場波動仍會影響其成本結構。","comment_en":"As a large office REIT, VNO's scale provides certain cost advantages. In property acquisition, financing, insurance, and property management, a larger operational scale helps reduce unit costs. For instance, compared to smaller owners, VNO may obtain more favorable prices when negotiating with suppliers. Furthermore, its diversified property portfolio helps mitigate risks and may achieve efficiency improvements through centralized procurement and management. However, the capital-intensive nature of the real estate industry means that scale advantages are not absolute, and market volatility can still affect its cost structure."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"VNO 在紐約曼哈頓等核心黃金地段擁有大量優質辦公物業，這些地理位置具有高度稀缺性和不可複製性。這些核心區域的土地成本極高，且新開發項目受到嚴格的規劃和環保限制，使得競爭對手難以複製其資產組合。優越的地理位置是吸引頂級租戶、維持較高入住率和租金水平的關鍵因素，構成了 VNO 重要的經濟護城河。","comment_en":"VNO owns a substantial portfolio of high-quality office properties in prime locations such as Manhattan, New York. These geographical locations possess high scarcity and are irreplicable. Land costs in these core areas are extremely high, and new development projects face stringent zoning and environmental regulations, making it difficult for competitors to replicate its asset portfolio. Superior locations are key factors in attracting top-tier tenants and maintaining high occupancy rates and rental levels, forming a significant economic moat for VNO."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"VNO 在物業管理和營運效率方面表現穩健。作為一家經驗豐富的 REIT，其擁有成熟的營運流程和專業團隊，能夠有效地管理龐大的物業組合，控制營運成本，並及時響應租戶需求。其 F-Score 為 6/9，顯示其在財務健康度方面有一定基礎。持續的自由現金流（FCF TTM $198.2M）也表明其營運能夠產生穩定的現金流入，支持其日常開支和債務償還。然而，房地產行業的週期性特徵意味著營運效率的極大化仍受宏觀經濟影響。","comment_en":"VNO demonstrates solid operational efficiency in property management. As an experienced REIT, it possesses mature operational processes and professional teams capable of effectively managing its vast property portfolio, controlling operating costs, and promptly responding to tenant needs. Its F-Score of 6/9 indicates a certain foundation in financial health. The consistent Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM $198.2M) also suggests that its operations generate stable cash inflows to support daily expenses and debt repayment. However, the cyclical nature of the real estate industry means that maximizing operational efficiency is still subject to macroeconomic influences."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"VNO 的資本配置策略對其長期價值至關重要。公司需要謹慎平衡股息支付、債務償還、物業收購和開發投資。其資產負債表顯示現金相對負債較少（現金 $580.5M / 負債 $8,142.7M），意味著其財務槓桿較高，資本配置決策需要更加審慎。過往的 ROE（0.2%）和 ROA（0.1%）數據顯示其資產回報率偏低，這可能與其高負債水平或投資回報率不佳有關。有效的資本配置，包括精準的收購和開發決策，是提升股東回報的關鍵。","comment_en":"VNO's capital allocation strategy is crucial for its long-term value. The company needs to carefully balance dividend payments, debt repayment, property acquisitions, and development investments. Its balance sheet shows relatively low cash compared to liabilities (Cash $580.5M / Debt $8,142.7M), indicating a high degree of financial leverage, which necessitates more prudent capital allocation decisions. Past ROE (0.2%) and ROA (0.1%) data show low asset returns, potentially related to its high debt levels or poor investment returns. Effective capital allocation, including precise acquisition and development decisions, is key to enhancing shareholder returns."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"辦公室租賃的客戶留存率受多重因素影響。雖然高轉換成本有助於維持一定的租戶穩定性，但租戶的續約決策仍會受到租金水平、租賃條款、公司自身發展需求以及市場上其他可替代物業的影響。VNO 的優質物業和良好管理有助於提升客戶滿意度和留存率，但其客戶留存並非像訂閱制服務那樣具有高度的內在黏性。租戶的流動性是辦公室 REIT 業務的常態。","comment_en":"Customer retention in office leasing is influenced by multiple factors. While high switching costs help maintain a certain level of tenant stability, tenants' renewal decisions are still affected by rental rates, lease terms, the company's own growth needs, and other available alternative properties in the market. VNO's high-quality properties and good management contribute to enhancing customer satisfaction and retention rates, but its customer retention does not possess the inherent stickiness of subscription-based services. Tenant turnover is a normal aspect of the office REIT business."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"VNO 的經濟護城河具有一定的持久性，主要源於其在核心城市黃金地段擁有的稀缺且不可複製的優質物業資產。這些資產的長期價值相對穩定，不易受到短期市場波動的劇烈影響。然而，辦公室 REIT 行業本身具有週期性，且受到宏觀經濟、利率變動、遠程辦公趨勢等外部因素的影響。因此，雖然其核心資產提供了穩固的基礎，但其長期表現仍需關注整體經濟環境和行業趨勢的變化。","comment_en":"VNO's economic moat possesses a degree of durability, primarily stemming from its ownership of scarce and irreplicable high-quality properties in prime locations within core cities. The long-term value of these assets is relatively stable and not easily subject to severe short-term market fluctuations. However, the office REIT industry itself is cyclical and influenced by external factors such as the macroeconomic environment, interest rate changes, and remote work trends. Therefore, while its core assets provide a solid foundation, its long-term performance still requires attention to changes in the overall economic environment and industry trends."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"VNO 的經濟護城河主要建立在其於紐約等核心市場擁有的稀缺、優質且難以複製的辦公物業資產之上，這構成了其最強的壁壘（M6）。規模效應（M5）和租戶轉換成本（M3）也提供了一定的支持。然而，其業務模式缺乏網絡效應（M4）和專利特許（M2），品牌定價權（M1）和客戶留存（M9）相對有限。公司在資本配置（M8）和資產回報率方面面臨挑戰，其高槓桿率需謹慎管理。總體而言，VNO 屬於一種『收費橋』類型的公司，其價值依賴於核心資產的穩定租金收入，但易受宏觀經濟週期影響，護城河的持久性有待觀察。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"VNO's economic moat is primarily built upon its scarce, high-quality, and difficult-to-replicate office property assets in core markets like New York, forming its strongest barrier (M6). Scale effects (M5) and tenant switching costs (M3) also provide some support. However, its business model lacks network effects (M4) and patent exclusivity (M2), with relatively limited brand pricing power (M1) and customer retention (M9). The company faces challenges in capital allocation (M8) and asset returns, with its high leverage requiring careful management. Overall, VNO can be characterized as a 'toll bridge' type of company, where its value relies on stable rental income from core assets, but it is susceptible to macroeconomic cycles, and the durability of its moat remains to be observed.","evidenceHash":"3e19abd6c907b0faf1ca9ee2ea77412a5b82502447580c275029324a1a0cb2a0","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"3e19abd6c907b0faf1ca9ee2ea77412a5b82502447580c275029324a1a0cb2a0","currentEvidenceHash":"3e19abd6c907b0faf1ca9ee2ea77412a5b82502447580c275029324a1a0cb2a0"},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:13:43.208Z","evidenceHash":"cefea8fcbb562b07792da3125a86e131894a3e73677299a23e27bb8ec7287c4f"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:13:43.208Z","evidenceHash":"cefea8fcbb562b07792da3125a86e131894a3e73677299a23e27bb8ec7287c4f"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VNO.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VNO.png","website":"https://www.vno.com","ceo":"Steven Roth","full_time_employees":"3145","description":"Vornado's property holdings are predominantly focused on the crucial New York City market, complemented by a top-tier asset in both Chicago and San Francisco. The company is also at the forefront of the real estate sector regarding its sustainability initiatives. Demonstrating this commitment, Vornado manages an extensive portfolio exceeding 23 million square feet of LEED-certified buildings and was recognized with the Energy Star Partner of the Year Award for Sustained Excellence in 2019. A significant corporate milestone was reached in 2012 when Vornado celebrated five decades of being listed on the New York Stock Exchange.","description_en":"Vornado's property holdings are predominantly focused on the crucial New York City market, complemented by a top-tier asset in both Chicago and San Francisco. The company is also at the forefront of the real estate sector regarding its sustainability initiati